        "description": "Variable intellectual disability",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Pathogenic L1CAM mutation plus at least two major clinical features (hydrocephalus and adducted thumbs)",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is confirmatory; clinical presentation may vary in severity."
